Cornhole for a cause!

Last week, we came together for a little friendly competition at the 5th Annual AEC Industry Cornhole Competition. This years' event benefitted @thekennymile! This cause holds a special place in our hearts at SW+, and we loved seeing everyone come out to support its mission of creating more connected communities through the completion of The Kenny Mile and the Mount Pleasant Way. 

A big congratulations to @iskagna for taking home first place! 🏆

